--
-- PostGIS values and indexes through every move: each table's EWKB
-- (raster WKB) is byte-identical after checkout, reset back and forward,
-- a merge into a branch that never had the tables, cherry-pick, revert
-- and revert of the revert; the spatial indexes the moves maintain agree
-- with sequential scans; typmods are kept and enforced.
--
\set ECHO none
anchor|t
branch bare|t
tables on prolly|t
indexes before|brin agree (3 operators), geog agree (2 operators), gist agree (14 operators), nd agree (6 operators), spgist agree (4 operators)
branch|t
checkout|t
checkout: same|t
checkout: indexes|brin agree (3 operators), geog agree (2 operators), gist agree (14 operators), nd agree (6 operators), spgist agree (4 operators)
checkout: typmods|geometry(PointZ,4326),geography(Polygon,4326)
checkout: no Z refused|22023 Column has Z dimension but geometry does not
checkout: a point refused|22023 Geometry type (Point) does not match column type (Polygon)
checkout main|t
edits change the state|t
reset back|t
reset back: same|t
reset back: indexes|brin agree (3 operators), geog agree (2 operators), gist agree (14 operators), nd agree (6 operators), spgist agree (4 operators)
reset forward|t
reset forward: same|t
reset forward: indexes|brin agree (3 operators), geog agree (2 operators), gist agree (14 operators), nd agree (6 operators), spgist agree (4 operators)
checkout bare|t
bare has none|t
commit bare|t
merge|{0,0,"merge successful"}
merge: a merge commit|t
merge: same|t
merge: indexes|brin agree (3 operators), geog agree (2 operators), gist agree (14 operators), nd agree (6 operators), spgist agree (4 operators)
merge: typmods|geometry(PointZ,4326),geography(Polygon,4326)
branch at c1|t
checkout pick|t
cherry-pick|{0,0,0}
cherry-pick: same|t
cherry-pick: indexes|brin agree (3 operators), geog agree (2 operators), gist agree (14 operators), nd agree (6 operators), spgist agree (4 operators)
revert|{0,0,0}
revert: same as c1|t
revert: indexes|brin agree (3 operators), geog agree (2 operators), gist agree (14 operators), nd agree (6 operators), spgist agree (4 operators)
revert again|{0,0,0}
revert again: same as c2|t
revert again: indexes|brin agree (3 operators), geog agree (2 operators), gist agree (14 operators), nd agree (6 operators), spgist agree (4 operators)
typmods|geometry(PointZ,4326),geography(Polygon,4326)
another SRID refused|22023 Geometry SRID (3857) does not match column SRID (4326)
checkout main|t
